Subject: [PATCH] Kompakt: the home screen makes room for the mini player

The home screen stacked the Play random button, the labelled tabs and the
mini player at the bottom. While something is loaded, which is when the mini
player shows, the button is hidden and the tabs drop their labels (icons and
the selected pill only); both return once the mini player has gone.

Change-Id: I581d5971673bb51733b02a93dce50f83b95414be
---
 .../org/lineageos/twelve/fragments/MainFragment.kt  | 13 +++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 13 insertions(+)

diff --git a/app/src/main/java/org/lineageos/twelve/fragments/MainFragment.kt b/app/src/main/java/org/lineageos/twelve/fragments/MainFragment.kt
